#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:5
#: 66c82788e1e7408a85702716ff37ef8b ac118270e1574bb9894b8b8d79643759
msgid "Limiting Maximum Battery Power Draw"
msgstr "限制最大电池功率消耗"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:7
#: 8fb3e77e17ae4cbea891e9ef3920022a
msgid ""
"Often, long range vehicles utilize lower C rating batteries to maximize "
"battery power to weight ratio. Unfortunately, some situations, especially "
"QuadPlane transitions which have full throttle power applied to forward "
"motors during the transition, can cause excessive battery voltage sag with "
"lower C rated batteries. This can lead to permanent damage in some kinds of "
"batteries (LiPo for example) if the cell voltage drops too low. In addition,"
" this can cause premature battery failsafes, or even crashes. This topic "
"discusses ways to limit the maximum power draw from batteries."
msgstr ""
"通常，长航程飞行器使用较低 C 值的电池以最大化电池功率重量比。不幸的是，某些情况下，特别是 QuadPlane 过渡时对前向电机施加满油门，可能导致低"
" C "
"值电池出现过度电压下垂。这可能导致某些类型电池（如锂聚合物电池）在单节电压过低时造成永久损坏。此外，这可能导致过早触发电池失控保护，甚至坠机。本文讨论限制电池最大功率消耗的方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:10
#: 3c6feb0cc503404c9e994c33b1b22fd6
msgid "Methods to Limit Maximum Power Draw"
msgstr "限制最大功率消耗的方法"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:12
#: 4e55b2c8104f44cba0983372a8755783
msgid ""
"The first and simplest is to restrict :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` to a lower "
"value. This limits the maximum throttle applied in throttle controlled modes"
" (AUTO, FBWB, CRUISE, etc.). Unfortunately, while this could be used to "
"limit maximum power to the forward motors in a QuadPlane transition, it will"
" also limit it in normal fixed wing throttle controlled modes also, when the"
" VTOL motors are not running and adding to the total instantaneous battery "
"power being drawn."
msgstr ""
"第一种也是最简单的方法是将 :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` 限制为较低值。这限制了油门控制模式（AUTO、FBWB、CRUISE "
"等）中施加的最大油门。不幸的是，虽然这可用于限制 QuadPlane 过渡中对前向电机的最大功率，但在 VTOL "
"电机不运行、不向总瞬时电池功率消耗添加功率的正常固定翼油门控制模式中，也会限制功率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:14
#: bd7f260d0bac461ab0ba441346a43c2c
msgid "A better way is to use one or more of the power limiting parameters:"
msgstr "更好的方法是使用一个或多个功率限制参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:16
#: 9e24ab34d875437ab9951f4d9a59b362
msgid ":ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>`"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:18
#: 582595d57adf4cbaa915765eb90ad5a9
msgid ""
"The :ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>` parameter (``BATTx_WATT_MAX``, for "
"any additional batteries) to limit the total instantaneous power that can be"
" drawn from the battery(s) by the forward motors. This will help issues "
"during QuadPlane transitions."
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>` "
"参数（``BATTx_WATT_MAX``，适用于任何额外电池）用于限制前向电机从电池消耗的总瞬时功率。这将有助于解决 QuadPlane "
"过渡期间的问题。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:20
#: 52e6a7e4ef504346af2bc9f89a5a6018
msgid ""
"If battery wattage (voltage * current) exceeds this value then the system "
"will reduce max throttle (:ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`, "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>` and :ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>` for reverse "
"thrust) to be below :ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>`. If power demand is "
"reduced, the max throttle will slowly grow back to :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` "
"(or :ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>` ) and/or :ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>`, "
"even if demanding the current max but as long as power remains under the "
"watt max. Use 0 (default) to disable this feature."
msgstr ""
"如果电池瓦特数（电压×电流）超过此值，系统将降低最大油门（:ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>`、:ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>`"
" 和用于反推力的 :ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>`）以保持在 :ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>` "
"以下。如果功率需求降低，最大油门将缓慢增长回 :ref:`THR_MAX<THR_MAX>` （或 "
":ref:`TKOFF_THR_MAX<TKOFF_THR_MAX>`）和/或 "
":ref:`THR_MIN<THR_MIN>`，即使要求当前最大值，只要功率保持在瓦特最大值以下。使用0（默认）禁用此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:22
#: 05dbfdca5cc045ccba72c9ff80e946d8
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Since this limit is applied to the throttle slowly (~10%/second), it may not"
" react fast enough in some situations to prevent battery sag at the "
"beginning of transition. Setting the :ref:`THR_SLEWRATE<THR_SLEWRATE>` to "
"50% or less per second to prevent rapid application of maximum forward "
"throttle at the beginning of transition, will help prevent this."
msgstr ""
"由于此限制是缓慢施加到油门的（约10%/秒），在某些情况下可能反应不够快，无法在过渡开始时防止电池下垂。将 "
":ref:`THR_SLEWRATE<THR_SLEWRATE>` 设置为50%/秒或更低，以防止过渡开始时最大前向油门快速施加，将有助于防止这种情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:24
#: f0e8557683be42f6b4c1f0b2f045cccf
msgid ""
"This only affects the forward motors, VTOL motors are unaffected by "
":ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>`."
msgstr "这只影响前向电机，VTOL 电机不受 :ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>` 影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:26
#: f574fd97cd0141999265c01fc0df4956
msgid ":ref:`Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX<Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX<Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:28
#: bffeb1a42d4c45988da2bfa1296eca02
msgid ""
"This can be used to limit the maximum current when the VTOL motors are "
"active. Power will be reduced to the VTOL motors to prevent exceeding this "
"value."
msgstr "当 VTOL 电机激活时，可用此参数限制最大电流。VTOL 电机的功率将降低以防止超过此值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:30
#: 61d42cf995404ea9b33d6c12cee1d1e1
msgid ":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>`"
msgstr ":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:32
#: 0116226c63254761b30d44c89bb5c663
msgid ""
"This has two effects if non-zero. First, it sets the lower limit for thrust "
"scaling versus voltage. If :ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX>` is non-"
"zero, then voltage compensation is applied to throttle to offset battery "
"voltage variations on thrust. Second, it sets a lower limit on battery "
"voltage sag by predicting the throttle value that would cause this, using an"
" estimate of battery internal resistance calculated during flight. It will "
"limit current applied to the VTOL motors to prevent this from occurring. If "
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX<Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX>` is also  non-zero, then it will "
"use the lower of the two limits, the one set by "
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX<Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX>` or predicted internally using "
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>`  as the minimum voltage sag "
"target."
msgstr ""
"如果非零，此参数有两个效果。第一，它设置推力缩放与电压的下限。如果 :ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MAX>` "
"非零，则对油门应用电压补偿以抵消电池电压变化对推力的影响。第二，它通过预测会导致电压下垂的油门值，使用飞行期间计算的电池内阻估算，设置电池电压下垂的下限。它将限制施加到"
" VTOL 电机的电流以防止这种情况发生。如果 :ref:`Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX<Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX>` 也非零，则将使用 "
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX<Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX>` 设定的限制与使用 "
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>` 作为最小电压下垂目标内部预测的限制中较低的那个。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:34
#: 47e1b16af5fe4a2f921e7c71b09a848c
msgid ""
"the battery used for monitoring and the battery resistance estimate is "
"determined by  :ref:`Q_M_BAT_IDX<Q_M_BAT_IDX>`"
msgstr "用于监控的电池和电池内阻估算由 :ref:`Q_M_BAT_IDX<Q_M_BAT_IDX>` 决定"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:36
#: 25dc976e46634f02be782df1eb201e94
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Setting :ref:`Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX<Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX>` to 150% of hover current "
"is a good starting point, while 3.3V * number of cells is a good value for "
":ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>`."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX<Q_M_BAT_CURR_MAX>` "
"设置为悬停电流的150%是一个良好的起始点，而3.3V×电池节数对 :ref:`Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN<Q_M_BAT_VOLT_MIN>` "
"是一个好值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:41
#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:9
#: 1c77cdf7ee924e2ab9ff57deb35e71e9 be94c38162624afc95165e5ba28d7b02
msgid "How to Set Max Watts"
msgstr "如何设置最大瓦特数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:10
#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:42
#: 3ff18175919346919f760710901bd364 686ac55dac5f465f82f4a4ccd29e62b3
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"By examining a post run dataflash log, and noting anywhere excessive battery"
" voltage sag first occurs, you can take the battery voltage and current at "
"that point, multiply to obtain the power, and set the "
":ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>` to below that value. 80% to 70% of the "
"value noted at the sag point would be a good value to start with."
msgstr ""
"通过查看飞行后的 dataflash 日志，找到首次出现电池电压明显跌落的位置，将该点的电池电压与电流相乘得到功率，然后把 "
":ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>` 设为低于该值。以跌落点数值的 80% 到 70% 作为起始值比较合适。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-batt-watt-max.rst:14
#: 9b20d73afb7f45a19490b993733c9120
msgid ""
"You can use :ref:`MOT_BAT_WATT_TC <MOT_BAT_WATT_TC>` to smooth the "
"application of the :ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>` limit."
msgstr ""
"可以使用 :ref:`MOT_BAT_WATT_TC <MOT_BAT_WATT_TC>` 来平滑 "
":ref:`BATT_WATT_MAX<BATT_WATT_MAX>` 限制的施加过程。"
